{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我想医治以色列的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲的罪孽和撒马利亚的罪恶就显露出来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们行事虚谎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"内有贼人入室偷窃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外有强盗成群骚扰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们心里并不思想我记念他们的一切恶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们所行的现在缠绕他们，都在我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["宫廷内乱"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"他们行恶使君王欢喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说谎使首领喜乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都是行淫的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像火炉被烤饼的烧热，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从抟面到发面的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暂不使火着旺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我们王宴乐的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领因酒的烈性成病；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王与亵慢人拉手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领埋伏的时候，心中热如火炉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就如烤饼的整夜睡卧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了早晨火气炎炎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众民也热如火炉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧灭他们的官长。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的君王都仆倒而死；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们中间无一人求告我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列和列邦"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"以法莲与列邦人搀杂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲是没有翻过的饼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人吞吃他劳力得来的，他却不知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"头发斑白，他也不觉得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的骄傲当面见证自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽遭遇这一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们仍不归向耶和华—他们的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不寻求他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲好像鸽子愚蠢无知；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们求告埃及，投奔亚述。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们去的时候，我必将我的网撒在他们身上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要打下他们，如同空中的鸟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必按他们会众所听见的惩罚他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们因离弃我，必定有祸；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因违背我，必被毁灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我虽要救赎他们，他们却向我说谎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他们并不诚心哀求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃在床上呼号；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们为求五谷新酒聚集，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仍然悖逆我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我虽教导他们，坚固他们的膀臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们竟图谋抗拒我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们归向，却不归向至上者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们如同翻背的弓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的首领必因舌头的狂傲倒在刀下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这在埃及地必作人的讥笑。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}